      "name": "Azhar Umar",
      "created_at": "2022-09-14T01:19:46.113Z",
      "cooked": "<p>We use Delivery Charges as a non-stock item. Can anyone help me with excluding non-stock items from gross profit calculation in Gross Profit reports?</p>\n<p>Is this possible?</p>",
      "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/discuss.frappe.io/azhar_umar/{size}/54334_2.png",
