      "id": 338336,
      "username": "peterg",
      "name": "Peter",
      "created_at": "2022-09-15T02:48:00.949Z",
      "cooked": "<p>Hi there,</p>\n<p>I don’t believe that’s possible with the default gross profit report. You’d have to customize the existing report or build your own.</p>\n<p>Edited to add: Have you considered adding your delivery charges to the Sales Taxes and Charges section of your invoice? That’s how ERPNext expects you to handle delivery fees. That allows you to use the Shipping Rule feature as well.</p>",
      "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/discuss.frappe.io/peterg/{size}/55463_2.png",
      "trust_level": 2,
      "post_number": 2,
      "post_type": 1,
      "like_count": null,
